# Implementation Plan: Senior Software Audit Fixes & Multi-Model Platform Alignment

This plan addresses all critical blockers, architectural defects, and production gaps identified in the Senior Software Audit for the Sentinel Gujarat CCTV Central Platform (covering Model 1, Model 2, Model 3, and Model 4).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Authentication Flow**: Route guards will now protect all `/vms`, `/cameras`, `/map`, and `/federation` routes. The default route redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`. Preconfigured official credentials (e.g., `superadmin@gujarat.gov.in` / `admin123` for State Admin and `ahmedabad.police@gujarat.gov.in` / `police123` for Department Admin) will be documented and functional.
> - **OCR & Python Dependencies**: We will integrate EasyOCR with fallback to a lightweight OpenCV-based OCR pipeline for plate character segmentation, ensuring ANPR operates seamlessly on both GPU/CPU environments.
> - **Database Compatibility**: Database connections will support standard PostgreSQL (`DATABASE_URL`) with automated SQLite fallback.

